#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md
msgid "react component, file template, live template, jsx"
msgstr "React コンポーネント, File Template, Live Template, JSX"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:7
msgid "Create a React Component"
msgstr "React コンポーネントの作成"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{bdg-success}`Native`"
msgstr "{bdg-success}`Native`"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:11
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "目標"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:13
msgid ""
"Quickly scaffold a new React component file with proper structure, "
"including the `@react.component` decorator and a `make` function."
msgstr ""
"`@react.component` デコレータと `make` 関数を含む、適切な構造の React コンポーネント"
"ファイルを素早く作成します。"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:15
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "手順"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:17
msgid "1. Create a new component file"
msgstr "1. 新しいコンポーネントファイルを作成する"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:19
msgid ""
"Right-click on the target directory in the **Project** panel and select "
"**New > ReScript Component**."
msgstr ""
"**Project** パネルで対象ディレクトリを右クリックし、**New > ReScript Component** を"
"選択します。"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:21
msgid ""
"Enter the component name (e.g., `UserCard`). The plugin creates a new "
"`.res` file with the basic component skeleton already in place."
msgstr ""
"コンポーネント名（例: `UserCard`）を入力します。プラグインが基本的なコンポーネントの"
"ひな形を含む新しい `.res` ファイルを作成します。"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:23
msgid "2. Use the `comp` live template"
msgstr "2. `comp` Live Template を使用する"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If you prefer to start from an empty file or add a component to an "
"existing file, type `comp` and press {kbd}`Tab`:"
msgstr ""
"空のファイルから始めたい場合や、既存のファイルにコンポーネントを追加したい場合は、"
"`comp` と入力して {kbd}`Tab` を押します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:35
msgid "The cursor is placed inside the JSX so you can start editing immediately."
msgstr "カーソルが JSX 内に配置されるので、すぐに編集を開始できます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:37
msgid "3. Add props"
msgstr "3. props を追加する"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:39
msgid ""
"Define your component's props by adding labeled arguments to the `make` "
"function:"
msgstr ""
"`make` 関数にラベル付き引数を追加して、コンポーネントの props を定義します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Code completion ({kbd}`Ctrl+Space`) provides suggestions for React APIs "
"and module members as you type."
msgstr ""
"コード補完（{kbd}`Ctrl+Space`）により、入力中に React API やモジュールメンバーの"
"候補が表示されます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:52
msgid "4. Use JSX auto-close"
msgstr "4. JSX 自動閉じタグを使用する"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:54
msgid ""
"When you type `>` to close an opening tag, the plugin automatically "
"inserts the corresponding closing tag:"
msgstr ""
"開始タグを閉じるために `>` を入力すると、プラグインが対応する閉じタグを自動的に"
"挿入します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:61
msgid "Expected Result"
msgstr "期待される結果"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:63
msgid "A working React component file with:"
msgstr "以下を備えた動作する React コンポーネントファイル:"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:65
msgid "The `@react.component` decorator"
msgstr "`@react.component` デコレータ"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:66
msgid "A `make` function with typed props"
msgstr "型付き props を持つ `make` 関数"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:67
msgid "JSX body with proper structure"
msgstr "適切な構造の JSX ボディ"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:69
msgid "Related Features"
msgstr "関連機能"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:71
msgid ""
"[File Templates](../features/code-editing.md) --- **New > ReScript "
"Component** for file creation"
msgstr ""
"[File Templates](../features/code-editing.md) --- ファイル作成用の **New > ReScript "
"Component**"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:72
msgid ""
"[Live Templates](../features/code-completion.md) --- `comp` and other "
"snippets"
msgstr ""
"[Live Templates](../features/code-completion.md) --- `comp` などのスニペット"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:73
msgid ""
"[Code Completion](../features/code-completion.md) --- LSP-powered "
"intelligent suggestions"
msgstr ""
"[Code Completion](../features/code-completion.md) --- LSP によるインテリジェントな候補表示"

#: ../../user/recipes/create-react-component.md:74
msgid ""
"[JSX Auto-Close](../features/code-editing.md) --- Automatic closing tag "
"insertion"
msgstr ""
"[JSX Auto-Close](../features/code-editing.md) --- 閉じタグの自動挿入"
